{
  "base": "a7847f2b",
  "claims": [
    "Without --max-output-bytes, every census export is byte-identical to the 1926e895 baseline.",
    "Every artifact the export writes is bounded by --max-output-bytes; above the bound the run exits 3 with ossie:output-size and publishes nothing.",
    "An invalid --max-output-bytes or --max-input-bytes exits 64 before any read.",
    "With --max-input-bytes N, gnd import ossie moves its read, YAML guard, JSON decode and loss-size caps to N (2N for loss-size) and keeps the model-size cap.",
    "input_policy.loads and JSONDecoder keep their 10 MiB default for every other caller."
  ],
